 "structural_change": "KDIE5-RTL2 10-22: top qkd_kvs_grp_h_r2d = qkd_kvs_grp_h_r2c + one exit flop copy per additional output word sharing an r2c exit flop (krsp vs rsp 1056 bits, o_pc1..3 vs o_pc0 56 bits each; kv_grp_portcopy.py, 0 edges): r2c gate d957 placement reg->out rsp[37] -714 ps / grp_h krsp[944] -1638 ps = one flop fixed at one pin driving a second pin ~0.5-1 mm away. KDIE5-RTL 10-22: top qkd_kvs_grp_h_r2c = bounded-driver structural copy (kv_grp_safe5.py, max 32 loads) of the ORFS mapped netlist of qkd_kvs_grp_h_r2 = the UNCHANGED release module qkd_kvs_grp_h (n32_pj) as u_core + face registers: no combinational in -> out path (o_dn 4 edges a hop, in-tile equalising delay so every group sees the fan word +29, gather own +3 / +4 a hop, cf1 fault inputs +2, EST / tok / tep +2). Frame, pins, macros, spine, reset landing = qkd_kvs_grp_h_r1. MAIN: relays placed by GPL.",
